articulate account of what happened.

32
00:02:47,460 --> 00:02:48,320
Miss Nahon.

33
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,180
I had a job in the human world.

34
00:02:52,520 --> 00:02:55,991
As you may have guessed, I
worked in the modeling industry.

35
00:02:56,340 --> 00:02:57,180
Uh, right.

36
