find a method to cure you as well.

63
00:04:50,240 --> 00:04:54,760
Until that time comes, please
do it for the good of humanity.

64
00:04:54,920 --> 00:04:57,980
You have our deepest gratitude.

65
00:04:58,840 --> 00:05:01,677
They poked and prodded me all over.

66
00:05:01,760 --> 00:05:04,180
made me into a lab rat.

67
