That's awful.

68
00:05:09,820 --> 00:05:11,585
But there was a silver lining.

69
00:05:12,220 --> 00:05:15,780
I became aware of my ability
to transverse through objects.

70
00:05:16,260 --> 00:05:19,848
I waited for the right moment,
and I escaped with my friends.

71
00:05:21,740 --> 00:05:26,337
Everyone else escaped through various
means, but all of our stories are the same.

72
00:05:26,420 --> 00:05:29,000
When I saw all their scars, I was furious.

73
00:05:30,480 --> 00:05:31,892
Were you with them, too?

74
00:05:32,020 --> 00:05:35,902
Up till the part where I ate a
peach and Mato and it went haywire.

75
00:05:36,040 --> 00:05:38,780
When I changed, the pain was excruciating.

76
00:05:39,660 --> 00:05:44,425
