to hold on to my intellect for years.

77
00:05:46,740 --> 00:05:50,600
When I had finally gotten things
under control, I met these guys.

78
00:05:50,860 --> 00:05:52,557
That must have been horrible.

79
00:05:52,640 --> 00:05:56,460
