are limited to my field of vision.

163
00:10:23,300 --> 00:10:26,065
But should I try teleporting
us farther inside?

164
00:10:27,160 --> 00:10:27,990
Hold it!

165
00:10:31,220 --> 00:10:32,920
That weapon-wielding Shuki.

166
00:10:33,760 --> 00:10:34,840
It's no joke.

167
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,414
The little slave must be just up ahead.

168
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,920
It looks like it.

169
00:10:39,980 --> 00:10:41,215
Yuki is the priority.

170
00:10:41,540 --> 00:10:42,980
Go on ahead without us.

171
00:10:43,760 --> 00:10:44,701
Thanks, you two.

172
00:10:45,600 --> 00:10:47,424
We'll meet you back here, Eisa.

173
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,500
Well, lucky you!

174
00:10:50,000 --> 00:10:52,377
Battling alongside your brilliant sister.

175
00:10:52,460 --> 00:10:54,757
This must be the thrill
of a lifetime, Himari.

176
00:10:54,840 --> 00:10:56,140
It sure is.

177
00:10:57,080 --> 00:10:59,460
It's death by asthma for these guys.

178
00:10:59,860 --> 00:11:03,272
Before the commanders come
back here, let's wipe them out.

179
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,660
You stay here.

180
00:11:12,980 --> 00:11:14,320
What are you...

181
00:11:18,400 --> 00:11:19,460
Miss Kyoka!

182
00:11:19,780 --> 00:11:22,297
