217
00:13:36,240 --> 00:13:37,200
His sister.

218
00:13:37,440 --> 00:13:39,028
Do you think it's possible?

219
00:13:41,040 --> 00:13:42,117
Let me explain.

220
00:13:42,200 --> 00:13:43,897
I'll tell you the whole story.

221
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:45,862
Everything that happened to her.

222
00:13:50,700 --> 00:13:52,280
Okay, but keep it brief.

223
00:13:59,500 --> 00:14:00,330
Perfect!

224
00:14:00,560 --> 00:14:02,677
All that's left is to set up the futon so

225
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:05,197
